During cross-host dogfood (2026-07-18), hammering the relay with room ops: 'c2c relay rooms send' failed with TWO error lines: 'relay answered HTTP 429 but the body did not report ok:false' + 'rate_limit_exceeded'. The first line indicates the 429 response body didn't match the expected error schema — the client should handle that gracefully (surface the retry_after if present, or a single clean rate-limit error) instead of a schema complaint plus a second error. Seen while relay PoW difficulty was 12 and rate limiting active.